{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421","id":3683588752,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62e-rX","number":113421,"title":"Hicon null error: Add permanent buffer and cache for DisplayServerWindows method","user":{"login":"archiethehead","id":182214766,"node_id":"U_kgDOCtxgbg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182214766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead","html_url":"https://github.com/archiethehead","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-12-02T01:36:33Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T12:54:11Z","closed_at":"2026-01-05T12:51:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113421","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #113350\r\n\r\nRectified an error seen with an intel graphics driver where persistent tab switching would result in an unusable editor and an error log pointing to display_server_windows.cpp. I believe the error comes down to local memory within the set_icon method being freed before Windows is done using it, in combination with multiple threads racing for the creation and destruction of the HICON variable. I am proposing these precautions as a potential fix:\r\n\r\n1. **Permanent Buffer and Cache:** Adding a cache and buffer variable to the class defaults that the method can draw from (set to null when an invalid image has been entered).\r\n2. **Lock Guard:** A mutex variable used to limit the use of the method to one thread at a time as an extra precaution against interference with in-use data.\r\n3. **Difference Check:** A conditional checks if the icon has actually changed before creating a new resource, opting to use the data in the buffer instead, decreasing chances of variable mutation during use.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421